{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51234","headline":"偈 · 神秀","name":"偈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（五祖弘忍一日会衆传法弟子，神秀呈偈出於壁间。\n）身是菩提树，心如明镜台。\n时时勤拂拭，勿使惹尘埃。\n（《嘉庆广东通志》三二八《释老传》引《指月录》）（此偈最早见於《六祖法宝坛经》。\n末句，敦煌本作「莫使有尘埃」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"神秀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}